{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/deployment-environments/runners/arm","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:05.987Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/deployment-environments/runners/arm/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/deployment-environments/runners/arm/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nThis is the image used to deploy and delete infrastructure via Azure Deployment Environments (ADE), specifically for Azure Resource Manager JSON templates and Bicep templates. Note that basing customization off of this image will only allow you to perform operations post-deployment of infrastructure. If you'd like to perform actions before and after, build off of the core image, and reference our open-source ARM/Bicep image on how to replicate deployment via ARM/Bicep in the container.\n\n## Featured Tags\n- `latest` ```docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/deployment-environments/runners/arm:latest``` \n\n## All Available Tags\n- `latest`\n- `2.3.3-preview`\n  \n## Usage\n\nTo base a custom image off of the core image, please use the following line in your Dockerfile:\n```\n    FROM mcr.microsoft.com/public/deployment-environments/runners/arm:{IMAGE_VERSION}\n```\n\nThen, you can reference our existing available images at our ADE GitHub repo to see how you can specify or modify certain shell scripts for deployment and deletion operations [here](https://github.com/Azure/deployment-environments/tree/main/Runner-Images/README.md).\n\n## Support\n\n[File an issue](https://github.com/Azure/deployment-environments/issues)\n\n[Additional Documentation about ADE](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/deployment-environments/)\n\n## License\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\nSee license terms [here](https://github.com/Azure/deployment-environments/blob/main/LICENSE).\n\nFor more information visit the [MAR Legal Notice](https://github.